                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d656cd9c-9e42-3408-b897-9adff307db43",
                                        "entry_id": "616f9d0b-f48f-3ce7-9bad-21d7aa1e4d9d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A member of the Spanish nobility, especially one without a title."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2ba1773a-3fdc-4dfc-b449-8c74f0470294",
                                                "sense_id": "d656cd9c-9e42-3408-b897-9adff307db43",
                                                "text": "The young man seems to entertain but an imperfect appreciation of the respect due from a menial to a Castilian hidalgo."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "e94f5e4e-29a7-4a44-9caa-542b010f7c5e",
                        "source_entry_id": "73195eec-43b1-30f1-ad1c-92565d3d710b",
                        "source_sense_id": "ec2fe14c-eb72-37f7-8103-75d9cd99035c",
                        "source_sense_description": "bezeichnet den niederen Adel in Spanien",
                        "target_lang_word": "hidalgo",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "hidalgo",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "bb5de04b-14eb-3b03-a3f6-516e448d0edd",
                                        "entry_id": "59f82e93-a345-3c04-82d1-93e142062fc9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Membre de la petite noblesse espagnole."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6cf682a8-99fe-48a3-96eb-370392ddc35a",
                                                "sense_id": "bb5de04b-14eb-3b03-a3f6-516e448d0edd",
                                                "text": "Léon de Lora, notre célèbre peintre de paysage, appartient à l’une des plus nobles familles du Roussillon, espagnole d’origine, et qui, si elle se recommande par l’antiquité de la race, est depuis cent ans vouée à la pauvreté proverbiale des Hidalgos."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3b11d87e-6285-40d3-8d24-929af5176f2f",
                                                "sense_id": "bb5de04b-14eb-3b03-a3f6-516e448d0edd",
                                                "text": "Ce noble hidalgo paraît bien nerveux!"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "db36616d-6475-4153-ac36-8cabbd2d09e2",
                                                "sense_id": "bb5de04b-14eb-3b03-a3f6-516e448d0edd",
                                                "text": "Ainsi, l’Espagnol avait ramené sa fraise avec arrogance et paradait, droit comme un i dont le point eût excessivement bavé, sévère comme un hidalgo qui eût avalé son sabre jusqu’au pommeau."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "d57efbd9-b4d4-4782-a699-37947cab7c0b",
                        "source_entry_id": "73195eec-43b1-30f1-ad1c-92565d3d710b",
                        "source_sense_id": "ec2fe14c-eb72-37f7-8103-75d9cd99035c",
                        "source_sense_description": "bezeichnet den niederen Adel in Spanien",
                        "target_lang_word": "hidalgo",
                        "target_lang_code": "nl",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "hidalgo",
                                "target_lang_code": "nl",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "cc407862-2326-30a2-8d43-177796b07f9f",
                                        "entry_id": "050f5176-c311-322c-be90-2ee30eb190b0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "man die tot de lagere Spaanse adel behoort"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5ba1edcc-c31d-4af8-a3ac-f0f15ee72674",
                                                "sense_id": "cc407862-2326-30a2-8d43-177796b07f9f",
                                                "text": "Het lag voor de hand dat Gilliam ooit Miguel de Cervantes’ tweedelige roman uit 1605 en 1615 zou verfilmen, \"De vernuftige edelman Don Quichot van La Mancha\". Daarin verliest een oude, armlastige hidalgo zijn verstand door het lezen van ridderverhalen en trekt met zijn haveloze paard Rocinante de wereld in om draken te verslaan en de edele maagd Dulcinea te dienen."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "4b5dc1eb-23cb-489b-8d7a-2c7df389d72a",
                        "source_entry_id": "73195eec-43b1-30f1-ad1c-92565d3d710b",
                        "source_sense_id": "ec2fe14c-eb72-37f7-8103-75d9cd99035c",
                        "source_sense_description": "bezeichnet den niederen Adel in Spanien",
                        "target_lang_word": "fidalgo",
                        "target_lang_code": "pt",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "fidalgo",
                                "target_lang_code": "pt",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "01e6e80f-ff78-3ea2-8cf9-eaa2681af42e",
                                        "entry_id": "6db8ce7b-f86a-3bd4-920a-cda85917cab4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "aquele que tem título de nobreza; nobre"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "929bc1fa-ecc6-4fd9-8e1b-c2671ee97d47",
                                                "sense_id": "01e6e80f-ff78-3ea2-8cf9-eaa2681af42e",
                                                "text": "Por que um jovem fidalgo espanhol no século 19 iria arriscar sua vida em defesa dos índios?"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "8d79957f-a42c-4fde-b5e3-56acd1bcb992",
                        "source_entry_id": "73195eec-43b1-30f1-ad1c-92565d3d710b",
                        "source_sense_id": "ec2fe14c-eb72-37f7-8103-75d9cd99035c",
                        "source_sense_description": "bezeichnet den niederen Adel in Spanien",
                        "target_lang_word": "hidalgo",
                        "target_lang_code": "es",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "hidalgo",
                                "target_lang_code": "es",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c532e49c-7269-3a5e-afaa-02c33f785f10",
                                        "entry_id": "d3c4b138-3beb-3316-b14f-c95f13d38feb",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Propio de, relativo o perteneciente a la nobleza, en especial los estamentos inferiores de la misma."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "noun"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "38d365a1-fb22-47d0-a46f-b268f8d5505c",
                                                "sense_id": "c532e49c-7269-3a5e-afaa-02c33f785f10",
                                                "text": "¿Qué rey de mis antepasados hizo a vuestro linaje hidalgo?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "16f7e319-a49d-4770-96b2-47cf3e82bbfa",
                                                "sense_id": "c532e49c-7269-3a5e-afaa-02c33f785f10",
                                                "text": "por algunos de sus rincones vagan todavía las sombras de estos hidalgos de Castilla, de capaz prietas y sombreros de plumas, que, lejos de su patria, perdieron la vida por crearlas."
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9f249cf5-e46d-38b0-9f08-11efdabf7b73",
                                        "entry_id": "d3c4b138-3beb-3316-b14f-c95f13d38feb",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Que muestra singular excelencia en alguno de sus rasgos, en especial en sentido moral."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e30c086a-99ab-415a-9326-18241a19aa45",
                                                "sense_id": "9f249cf5-e46d-38b0-9f08-11efdabf7b73",
                                                "text": "tan hidalgo corazón y generoso pecho tenía este gran príncipe."
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"2\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
